          deckDescription: 'The deck is the standard 48-card Hanafuda deck: twelve suits representing the months of the year, with four cards in each suit. There are no jokers; all cards are used in play.',
          suitDescription: 'The twelve Hanafuda suits are the months: Pine (January), Plum (February), Cherry (March), Wisteria (April), Iris (May), Peony (June), Bush Clover (July), Susuki Grass (August), Chrysanthemum (September), Maple (October), Willow (November), and Paulownia (December).',
